  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0027","literal","On the day Establishing Spring, they welcomed spring at the eastern suburb and sacrificed to the Green Thearch Gou Mang.","On the day Establishing Spring, they welcomed spring at the eastern suburb and sacrificed to the Green Thearch and Gou Mang.","祭青帝句芒 names two suburban cult recipients, the Green Thearch and Gou Mang; the fused literal name is wrong, and inserting and matches the paired seasonal cult pattern.","high","applied"],
    ["s0031","literal","On the day Establishing Summer, they welcomed summer at the southern suburb and sacrificed to the Red Thearch Zhu Rong.","On the day Establishing Summer, they welcomed summer at the southern suburb and sacrificed to the Red Thearch and Zhu Rong.","祭赤帝祝融 likewise names the Red Thearch and Zhu Rong as two recipients; the original literal wrongly merges them into one name.","high","applied"],
    ["s0037","literal","On the day Establishing Autumn, they welcomed autumn at the western suburb and sacrificed to the White Thearch Ru Shou.","On the day Establishing Autumn, they welcomed autumn at the western suburb and sacrificed to the White Thearch and Ru Shou.","祭白帝蓐收 names the White Thearch and Ru Shou as two cult recipients; the and-separated rendering corrects the fused literal.","high","applied"],
    ["s0042","literal","On the day Establishing Winter, they welcomed winter at the northern suburb and sacrificed to the Black Thearch Xuan Ming.","On the day Establishing Winter, they welcomed winter at the northern suburb and sacrificed to the Black Thearch and Xuan Ming.","祭黑帝玄冥 names the Black Thearch and Xuan Ming as two recipients; separating them restores the parallel five-suburb cult formula.","high","applied"],
    ["s0052","idiomatic","When the ceremonies ended, he presented himself to the empress and gave a banquet for the kings, marquises, and officials.","When the ceremonies ended, he received the eastern lords in audience, then feasted and rewarded the kings, marquises, and ministers.","東后 means the eastern feudal lords here; the emperor receives them in audience and then rewards the assembled nobles and ministers.","high","applied"],
    ["s0052","literal","When the affair was finished, then they had audience with the Eastern Empress and feasted and bestowed on kings, marquises, and the host of ministers.","When the rites were complete, he received the eastern lords in audience and held a banquet and bestowed gifts on the kings, marquises, and assembled ministers.","東后 means the eastern lords, not an Eastern Empress, and the emperor is the one receiving them in audience.","high","applied"]
  ],
